        "id": 54525,
        "name": "awp832",
        "username": "awp832",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-13T22:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;Reckless is correct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You have to understand that damage buffs/debuffs apply *any time*&nbsp; damage is dealt.&nbsp; So Martyr deals 5 damage (But damage is +1. So she deals herself 6 damage).&nbsp;&nbsp; She now attacks a target for an equal amount.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; She attacks Baron Blade for 6 damage&nbsp; (but damage is +1, so she deals 7 damage).&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Same logic still applies with Counterpoint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Damage self for 5 damage:&nbsp;&nbsp; +1=6 damage.&nbsp; -1 =5 damage.</p><p>5 damage attack vs Baron Blade,&nbsp; +1 damage=6 damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:28:59.916Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
