        "created_at": "2013-03-13T23:19:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dual Crowbars has different wording to Sacrosanct Martyr, which is why they work differently. Sacrosanct Martyr does X damage, whereas Dual Crowbars does \"the same\" damage.</p>",
