        "created_at": "2013-03-14T00:28:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ahh okay - see what I meant in that I haven't played Fanatic enough to know well the wording on her cards. Okay, I get it now - I thought that card specified dealing another target the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">same</span> damage, like Mr Fixer's Crowbars (which I already knew from that other thread don't get extra damage mods for the second hit). I didn't realise it was a second batch of damage. That's cool :). Yay for when she's grouped with Ra <span class=\"bbcode-i\">and</span> Legacy, then :D.</p>",
