        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yay for when she's grouped with Ra  and  Legacy, then :D.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Except that Ra will make her damage fire, and Sacrosanct Martyr requires it to be Radiant.&nbsp; (Though of course she has other abilities good for pairing with Ra).</p>",
